[E0421] Error: this call to itself is not a tail call
    ╭─[ err/108_tailrec/main.wip:14:54 ]
    │
 14 │ fn notTail(n: i64): i64 = if n == 0 { 0 } else { 1 + notTail(n - 1) }
    │                                                      ───────┬──────
    │                                                             ╰──────── its value is used by what is around it
    │
    │ Help: in a `@tailrec` function every call to itself is a jump: carry what is computed after the call in a parameter instead
    │
    │ Note: a tail call's value is the function's value, and nothing of the function runs after it
────╯
